 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.7em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;Hello! Thanks for stopping by.&nbsp;My name is Melisa Smith.&nbsp;I am a Stained Glass Artist, former Library Supervisor,&nbsp;Children&#39;s Program Director and &nbsp;a self proclaimed chef in my own home. Having spent several&nbsp;years working as a server and bartender&nbsp;during my college years in the Seattle area helped me out in the self proclaimed chef arena of my life. I have no formal training in cooking or photography&nbsp;but I hope you will enjoy the fun things I cook up and the adventures I am lucky&nbsp;enough to experience.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.7em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.7em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">How you can support my work:<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nYou can help support my website&nbsp;by sharing posts that you love with friends and family! This will help&nbsp;to reach a wider audience who may enjoy the content I&#39;m creating. I&#39;m also available for recipe development, reviews&nbsp;and photography&nbsp;should you be needing any of&nbsp;these services.&nbsp;Thank you so much for your support!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.7em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.7em; font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;The Glass Pantry is sure to be stocked&nbsp;full of interesting adventures in bread baking, sourdough, cheese mak